    -> WHERE a.district = 'California';

## 5-2 Write a query that returns the title of every film in which an actor with the first name JOHN appeared
#### Solution
mysql> SELECT title
    -> FROM film
    -> JOIN film_actor
    -> ON film.film_id = film_actor.film_id
    -> JOIN actor
    -> ON film_actor.actor_id = actor.actor_id
    -> WHERE actor.first_name = 'JOHN';

Or, we can use table alias as well (in this phase of learning, i still confused while 
using table alias). But, I managed to write it
mysql> SELECT f.title
    -> FROM film f
    -> JOIN film_actor fa
    -> ON f.film_id = fa.film_id
    -> JOIN actor a
    -> ON fa.actor_id = a.actor_id
    -> WHERE a.first_name = 'JOHN';

It's just the same, but in this case, table alias shortened the query. The output:
